WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.701 --> 00:00:03.868
♪♪

00:00:03.868 --> 00:00:05.734
[ Cheers and applause ]
-Let's get to the news.

00:00:05.734 --> 00:00:07.400
President Biden met today

00:00:07.400 --> 00:00:09.267
with members
of his administration

00:00:09.267 --> 00:00:11.701
to discuss lowering
consumer prices

00:00:11.701 --> 00:00:17.033
and also making sure both teams
get the ball in overtime.

00:00:17.033 --> 00:00:19.634
A federal judge in Texas
ruled on Friday

00:00:19.634 --> 00:00:22.901
that President Biden could not
require federal workers

00:00:22.901 --> 00:00:24.734
to receive
the coronavirus vaccine.

00:00:24.734 --> 00:00:27.434
Wow, nobody's letting Biden
get anything done.

00:00:27.434 --> 00:00:29.300
At this point,
I wouldn't be surprised if

00:00:29.300 --> 00:00:31.567
Wordle was only giving him
two rows.

00:00:31.567 --> 00:00:33.734
[ Laughter ]

00:00:33.734 --> 00:00:36.767
After the voting rights bills
failed to pass last week,

00:00:36.767 --> 00:00:39.200
White House Press Secretary
Jen Psaki

00:00:39.200 --> 00:00:42.701
advised people who are upset
to go to a kickboxing class

00:00:42.701 --> 00:00:45.868
or have a margarita,
because what better way to save

00:00:45.868 --> 00:00:50.000
democracy than with fun ideas
for first dates?

00:00:50.000 --> 00:00:52.567
They're stripping away
our rights one by one.

00:00:52.567 --> 00:00:56.200
Let's paint mugs.
[ Light laughter ]

00:00:56.200 --> 00:00:58.367
According to a new report,
Britain's Prince Andrew

00:00:58.367 --> 00:01:02.234
had a collection of more than
70 teddy bears and staff members

00:01:02.234 --> 00:01:05.501
were ordered to arrange them,
according to a diagram.

00:01:05.501 --> 00:01:08.634
And then they could get to work
on his enormous collection

00:01:08.634 --> 00:01:11.000
of giant red flags.

00:01:14.834 --> 00:01:18.467
The NFL reportedly notified
unvaccinated players last week

00:01:18.467 --> 00:01:20.200
that they will no longer
be required

00:01:20.200 --> 00:01:22.167
to be tested daily
for the coronavirus,

00:01:22.167 --> 00:01:25.234
in fact, some of them
don't even have to come to work.

00:01:27.267 --> 00:01:29.300
A television reporter
in West Virginia

00:01:29.300 --> 00:01:32.434
who was hit by a car during
a live broadcast last week

00:01:32.434 --> 00:01:37.434
got up uninjured and said quote,
"That's live TV for you."

00:01:37.434 --> 00:01:42.133
Okay, as someone who's done a
lot of live TV, no, it's not!

00:01:42.133 --> 00:01:43.501
[ Laughter ]

00:01:43.501 --> 00:01:47.934
Ashlee Simpson lip syncing,
that's live TV for you.

00:01:47.934 --> 00:01:50.667
You got hit by a car!

00:01:50.667 --> 00:01:52.467
"Oh my God,
should we exchange info?"

00:01:52.467 --> 00:01:56.634
"No, no, it's fine.
This is live TV."

00:01:56.634 --> 00:01:59.701
Rapper Jay-Z has reportedly
signed onto a letter

00:01:59.701 --> 00:02:03.367
urging New York Governor
Kathy Hochul and state lawmakers

00:02:03.367 --> 00:02:05.968
to ban prosecutors
from using rap lyrics

00:02:05.968 --> 00:02:08.133
as evidence against
defendants in court.

00:02:08.133 --> 00:02:11.334
Not because it's unfair
just because it's so cringe-y

00:02:11.334 --> 00:02:14.501
to hear lawyers recite them.
[ Laughter ]

00:02:14.501 --> 00:02:17.100
Singer Adele last week
postponed her Las Vegas

00:02:17.100 --> 00:02:19.801
residency less than 24 hours
before the first show.

00:02:19.801 --> 00:02:22.167
Fortunately, Adele fans
are well equipped

00:02:22.167 --> 00:02:24.367
to deal
with sudden heartbreak.

00:02:26.667 --> 00:02:28.968
And finally, according to
the latest numbers,

00:02:28.968 --> 00:02:31.467
New Yorkers place more than
600 million dollars

00:02:31.467 --> 00:02:34.334
in bets during the first week
of mobile sports gambling,

00:02:34.334 --> 00:02:36.667
all against the Knicks.

00:02:37.868 --> 00:02:41.667
President Biden was caught
on a hot microphone yesterday,

00:02:41.667 --> 00:02:45.234
referring to Fox News
reporter Peter Doocy as,

00:02:45.234 --> 00:02:48.534
"a stupid son of a bitch."

00:02:48.534 --> 00:02:52.400
Said Biden, "I am so sorry
that was supposed to be

00:02:52.400 --> 00:02:53.701
into the main mic."

00:02:53.701 --> 00:02:55.968
[ Laughter ]

00:02:55.968 --> 00:02:59.133
After he was caught referring
to Fox News reporter Peter Doocy

00:02:59.133 --> 00:03:01.534
as, "a stupid son of a bitch."

00:03:01.534 --> 00:03:05.234
President Biden reportedly
called Doocy to clear the air.

00:03:05.234 --> 00:03:06.868
And just like Biden
being elected,

00:03:06.868 --> 00:03:08.634
Doocy is going to pretend
it never happened.

00:03:10.334 --> 00:03:13.934
And to me, the crazy part of all
this isn't that Biden got mad.

00:03:13.934 --> 00:03:15.567
The Doocy tried
to make him look bad.

00:03:15.567 --> 00:03:17.634
It's that Biden was so surprised

00:03:17.634 --> 00:03:19.701
that Doocy tried
to make him look bad.

00:03:19.701 --> 00:03:21.968
Where are you, Ben, dude?
That's the game.

00:03:21.968 --> 00:03:23.801
Biden was like that kid
in fourth grade

00:03:23.801 --> 00:03:26.300
who wanted to play dodgeball
and then got super mad

00:03:26.300 --> 00:03:28.067
that someone whipped
a ball at him.

00:03:28.067 --> 00:03:32.334
[ Laughter ]

00:03:32.334 --> 00:03:34.801
As tensions increase between
the U.S. and Russia,

00:03:34.801 --> 00:03:36.634
White House
Press Secretary Jen Psaki

00:03:36.634 --> 00:03:39.634
warned yesterday that
American citizens in Ukraine

00:03:39.634 --> 00:03:40.968
should leave the country now,

00:03:40.968 --> 00:03:43.834
but added that no organized
evacuation is planned.

00:03:43.834 --> 00:03:46.534
Why is that? Because of the last
one you organized?

00:03:46.534 --> 00:03:49.667
[ Audience "Ohs" ]

00:03:49.667 --> 00:03:53.534
"We'd love to help out."
"We're good."

00:03:53.534 --> 00:03:55.634
"Just going to go on
Expedia, thank you."

00:03:57.067 --> 00:03:59.534
Yesterday marked
the start of tax season

00:03:59.534 --> 00:04:01.234
for those who celebrate.

00:04:05.234 --> 00:04:08.367
NASA announced yesterday
that the world's largest

00:04:08.367 --> 00:04:10.267
and most powerful
space telescope

00:04:10.267 --> 00:04:12.067
has reached
its observation post

00:04:12.067 --> 00:04:16.334
and is now one million miles
away from Earth -- Must be nice.

00:04:16.334 --> 00:04:18.567
[ Laughter ]

00:04:18.567 --> 00:04:19.934
Hilton announced yesterday

00:04:19.934 --> 00:04:22.400
that its Homewood Suites
chain of hotels

00:04:22.400 --> 00:04:26.400
is now 100 percent pet friendly,
while days in announcing

00:04:26.400 --> 00:04:29.801
they have enough animals
to worry about.

00:04:34.033 --> 00:04:37.367
It's nice to see two raccoons
and a snake getting along.

00:04:39.501 --> 00:04:41.734
Chris-- it's an uneasy peace.

00:04:43.501 --> 00:04:46.000
Krispy Kreme will offer
a dozen free donuts

00:04:46.000 --> 00:04:48.868
to anyone who donates blood
amid a national shortage.

00:04:48.868 --> 00:04:51.934
Tough break for anyone
who drank it already.

00:04:56.200 --> 00:04:59.501
Guys are out a dozen donuts.

00:04:59.501 --> 00:05:01.667
Finally, a couple in India
recently announced

00:05:01.667 --> 00:05:03.701
that they will have
their wedding in the metaverse

00:05:03.701 --> 00:05:05.534
and have invited
two thousand people.

00:05:05.534 --> 00:05:06.934
It's the perfect way to say

00:05:06.934 --> 00:05:09.267
"We don't want
our grandparents to come."

00:05:11.868 --> 00:05:13.534
"It's in the what?"

00:05:15.934 --> 00:05:17.934
Supreme Court Justice
Stephen Breyer

00:05:17.934 --> 00:05:21.100
is reportedly planning to retire
at the end of the current term,

00:05:21.100 --> 00:05:24.000
which would allow President
Biden to appoint a successor.

00:05:24.000 --> 00:05:27.968
Said Mitch McConnell, with only
three years left in his term,

00:05:27.968 --> 00:05:29.367
"I don't think so."

00:05:31.334 --> 00:05:33.767
President Biden visited
an ice cream store

00:05:33.767 --> 00:05:35.467
yesterday in Washington, D.C.

00:05:35.467 --> 00:05:38.234
and reportedly got
a scoop of chocolate

00:05:38.234 --> 00:05:39.534
with peanut butter flecks

00:05:39.534 --> 00:05:42.300
and a scoop of black
out chocolate cake.

00:05:42.300 --> 00:05:46.033
So, yeah, he's seen
the approval numbers.

00:05:48.267 --> 00:05:51.534
[ As Biden ] I'm going to need
a second scoop.

00:05:51.534 --> 00:05:54.367
[ Normal voice ] President Biden
met today with the CEOs of Ford,

00:05:54.367 --> 00:05:56.501
General Motors,
and several other companies

00:05:56.501 --> 00:05:58.601
to discuss his
"Build Back Better" agenda.

00:05:58.601 --> 00:06:01.167
But of course,
it quickly devolved into Biden

00:06:01.167 --> 00:06:02.567
pitching car names.

00:06:02.567 --> 00:06:05.367
[ As Biden ]
So what about the Ford Shark?

00:06:05.367 --> 00:06:07.534
That's a pretty good
name the Ford Shark.

00:06:11.133 --> 00:06:12.901
[ Normal voice ] President Biden
told reporters yesterday

00:06:12.901 --> 00:06:14.767
that a potential
Russian invasion of Ukraine

00:06:14.767 --> 00:06:16.834
would likely be
the quote largest invasion

00:06:16.834 --> 00:06:18.267
since World War Two.

00:06:18.267 --> 00:06:20.934
So I guess he's never been
to a target on Black Friday.

00:06:20.934 --> 00:06:23.000
[ Laughter ]

00:06:23.000 --> 00:06:25.267
In a video posted
on social media today,

00:06:25.267 --> 00:06:27.834
former President Trump
told a golfing partner

00:06:27.834 --> 00:06:29.367
that he would be the 45th

00:06:29.367 --> 00:06:32.367
and 47th president
of the United States.

00:06:32.367 --> 00:06:34.300
Then again, it wouldn't be
the first time

00:06:34.300 --> 00:06:37.534
he lied to a golf partner.

00:06:37.534 --> 00:06:39.334
[ As Trump ]
Put me down for four.

00:06:49.701 --> 00:06:53.367
Yeah, it's a four. It's a four.

00:06:55.400 --> 00:06:58.200
[ Normal voice ] After Vermont
Senator Bernie Sanders

00:06:58.200 --> 00:07:01.334
suggested that he would support
a primary challenger

00:07:01.334 --> 00:07:03.133
against Democratic
Senator Joe Manchin,

00:07:03.133 --> 00:07:06.834
Manchin said yesterday, "Senator
Sanders is not a Democrat."

00:07:06.834 --> 00:07:09.033
Said Sanders, "Thank you."

00:07:11.300 --> 00:07:14.534
Organizers of next month's
Winter Olympics in Beijing

00:07:14.534 --> 00:07:17.767
announced they will provide
free condoms to athletes,

00:07:17.767 --> 00:07:21.067
and I'm pretty excited
to find out what that event is.

00:07:21.067 --> 00:07:23.801
[ Laughter ]

00:07:23.801 --> 00:07:25.901
It seems weird
it's in the winter.

00:07:27.367 --> 00:07:29.701
Amazon endorsed the bill
in Congress yesterday

00:07:29.701 --> 00:07:32.133
that would legalize marijuana
on a federal level.

00:07:32.133 --> 00:07:34.167
Oh, really?
Does Amazon support something

00:07:34.167 --> 00:07:37.534
that would make it even harder
for people to go out to a store?

00:07:37.534 --> 00:07:38.834
[ Laughter ]

00:07:38.834 --> 00:07:43.667
"Alexa order Doritos.
Yes, make weekly."

00:07:43.667 --> 00:07:47.501
[ Light laughter ]

00:07:47.501 --> 00:07:50.634
And finally, musician Kid Rock
released a song

00:07:50.634 --> 00:07:53.033
this week that criticizes
coronavirus restrictions.

00:07:53.033 --> 00:07:54.567
Oh, buddy,
that's not why people

00:07:54.567 --> 00:07:56.834
are staying
six feet away from you.

00:07:59.133 --> 00:08:00.467
President Biden said today

00:08:00.467 --> 00:08:02.334
that he is planning
to name his nominee

00:08:02.334 --> 00:08:05.200
to replace retiring Supreme
Court Justice Stephen Breyer

00:08:05.200 --> 00:08:07.601
by the end of next month
and then a day or two

00:08:07.601 --> 00:08:10.234
after that,
he'll nickname the nominee.

00:08:10.234 --> 00:08:16.167
[ As Biden ]
Hey, Super Judge! Judge-a-reno!
I'll get one, don't worry.

00:08:16.167 --> 00:08:18.400
After White House press
secretary Jen Psaki

00:08:18.400 --> 00:08:20.801
said yesterday that President
Biden will stand by his

00:08:20.801 --> 00:08:23.801
commitment to appoint a black
woman to the Supreme Court.

00:08:23.801 --> 00:08:25.534
A Fox News panel criticized

00:08:25.534 --> 00:08:27.300
the administration's
selection process.

00:08:27.300 --> 00:08:28.767
I'll take a wild guess

00:08:28.767 --> 00:08:32.634
and say they have exactly
two problems with a black woman.

00:08:35.467 --> 00:08:38.767
The pharmaceutical company
Moderna announced yesterday

00:08:38.767 --> 00:08:42.033
that it has begun testing
its Omicron-specific

00:08:42.033 --> 00:08:45.434
coronavirus vaccine feels like
that might be outdated

00:08:45.434 --> 00:08:47.767
by the time it's ready.
That's like hearing that

00:08:47.767 --> 00:08:50.601
Apple's working on an iPhone 7.

00:08:52.767 --> 00:08:54.167
According to the latest numbers,

00:08:54.167 --> 00:08:58.000
the U.S. economy last quarter
grew by 6.9%.

00:08:58.000 --> 00:09:00.801
"My pleasure," said Spider-Man.

00:09:00.801 --> 00:09:03.234
[ Laughter ]

00:09:03.234 --> 00:09:04.334
According to a new report,

00:09:04.334 --> 00:09:06.567
a witness told
federal prosecutors

00:09:06.567 --> 00:09:09.234
that he was present
when Republican Congressman

00:09:09.234 --> 00:09:12.133
Matt Gaetz was told
that he had sex with a minor,

00:09:12.133 --> 00:09:14.667
and he said you could
have heard a pin drop

00:09:14.667 --> 00:09:16.634
at that homecoming dance.

00:09:23.901 --> 00:09:26.000
And almost in here.

00:09:29.434 --> 00:09:32.267
In honor of the park's
30th anniversary

00:09:32.267 --> 00:09:34.300
and Women's History Month
in March,

00:09:34.300 --> 00:09:36.000
Disneyland Paris
announced yesterday

00:09:36.000 --> 00:09:37.868
that Minnie Mouse
will wear a dark blue

00:09:37.868 --> 00:09:41.400
and black polka dotted pantsuit
designed by Stella McCartney.

00:09:41.400 --> 00:09:44.033
Unfortunately, that still won't
make up for the fact

00:09:44.033 --> 00:09:45.567
that you brought
your wife to Paris

00:09:45.567 --> 00:09:47.000
and then took her
to Disneyland.

00:09:49.267 --> 00:09:51.200
Hey, you see the pantsuit.

00:09:53.501 --> 00:09:55.767
A representative of
the anti-drug group

00:09:55.767 --> 00:09:59.300
D.A.R.E. criticize the HBO show
"Euphoria," in a new interview,

00:09:59.300 --> 00:10:02.634
and said it glorifies narcotics
use among high school students.

00:10:02.634 --> 00:10:05.734
But realistically,
how many teens can afford

00:10:05.734 --> 00:10:08.300
HBO and narcotics?

00:10:08.300 --> 00:10:11.701
[ Laughter ]

00:10:11.701 --> 00:10:14.467
McDonald's is set to begin
selling a new item

00:10:14.467 --> 00:10:17.334
consisting of a chicken
sandwich, Big Mac,

00:10:17.334 --> 00:10:19.634
and Filet-O-Fish,
all in one bun called

00:10:19.634 --> 00:10:22.601
Land, Air, and Sea,
as opposed to its original name

00:10:22.601 --> 00:10:24.801
Bathroom Hospital Cemetery.

00:10:27.801 --> 00:10:30.033
And a different way.

00:10:30.033 --> 00:10:32.334
And finally, the Navy announced
yesterday

00:10:32.334 --> 00:10:34.901
that it has discharged
45 sailors

00:10:34.901 --> 00:10:37.267
for refusing to get
the coronavirus vaccine.

00:10:37.267 --> 00:10:38.901
Wow, I didn't realize the virus

00:10:38.901 --> 00:10:40.868
could be transmitted
through seamen.

00:10:44.534 --> 00:10:48.000
Discharged, discharged seamen.

00:10:48.000 --> 00:10:51.534
[ Laughter ]

00:10:51.534 --> 00:10:53.801
And that was the show
for the whole night.

